## 5. Target PDP layout

Working prototype: `bioblanks-pdp-prototype.html` (open in a browser, uses
real product images from the Webflow CDN and real Fourthwall variant IDs).

### Layout

- 50/50 split, gallery left, panel right
- Gallery runs full-bleed to the top of the viewport; floating chrome overlays it
- Each shot `width: 100%`, `aspect-ratio: 4/5`, `object-fit: cover` — no visible background
- Thumbnail rail overlays the top-left of the gallery in a **zero-height sticky wrapper** so it takes no layout space
- Panel is sticky, `height: 100vh`, flex column: breadcrumb → tabs → scrolling content → docked button

### Type scale

| Element | Size |
|---|---|
| Product title | 24px |
| Price (beside title, right-aligned, baseline) | 24px |
| Body, section headers | 12px |
| Breadcrumb | 10px uppercase, `letter-spacing: .12em` |

### Thumbnails (gallery + colorway swatches, identical)

- No padding, no border, no background
- `border-radius: 4px` via `--thumb-radius`
- Inactive `opacity: .38`, hover `.7`, active `1`, 250ms

### Tabs

- Flat labels, 26px gap, no pill, no divider line
- Gold dot (`#FFD700`) left of the active label
- Soft gold glow beneath the active label: `height: 2.5px`, `blur(6px)`, `opacity: .42`, `bottom: 6px`
- Active text `#333332`, inactive `#A3A39D`

Note: the catalog page uses gold `#FFD700`; the old PDP used green
`rgba(116,240,129,.30)`. **Gold is the decision** for the PDP.

### Overview tab order

1. Title + price
2. SKU
3. Description (full panel width)
4. **Product Details** — collapsible, starts closed
5. **Wholesale Pricing** — collapsible, starts closed
6. Colorway swatches
7. Size selector (XS–2XL, 6-across grid)

Accordion icon is a `+` built from two 8px bars; the vertical bar rotates 90°
and fades to become `−`. Bodies animate via `grid-template-rows: 0fr → 1fr`
with `overflow: hidden` — no hardcoded heights.

### Buttons

One visible at a time, driven by the active tab:

- Overview / Materials / Size & Fit → **Add to Cart**
- Customization → **Start New Project**

`Add to Cart` is disabled until a size is selected. No helper text.

### Breadcrumb

`TEES • WOMEN'S CLASSIC TEE` — category and item only, no "Catalog" level.
Sits above the tabs inside the panel. Category links to
`/product-catalog?category={slug}`.

