## 8. Gotchas

**jsDelivr `@main` caches for 12 hours.** Always deploy from tags.

**Webflow Designer class styles beat single-class selectors.** Tab rules need
`.product-header_tabs-menu .product-header_tab-link` plus `!important` on
contested properties.

**`.element-decorate` was display-toggled** by the old embed. With that gone,
Designer's `display` took over — force `display: block !important` and animate
opacity.

**Webflow number fields are integers only.** Prices are stored in cents.

**`Product Catalogs` is at Webflow's 10-reference-field cap.** The
`Colorways` multi-reference was rejected. Not needed — filter a Collection List
by "Product = Current" instead. Four dead Shopify reference fields could be
deleted to free slots: `product-collections-2`, `product-type-4`,
`product-option-2-values-2`, `product-option-3-values-2`.

**Slater page routing was broken by an off-by-one-letter bug** — it targeted
`detail_product` (dead template) instead of `detail_products` (live). Don't
port URL-segment routing; use explicit `data-page` attributes.

**Webflow custom code is inlined per page** and re-downloaded every pageview.
The repo file is CDN-cached across the session. Keep code in the repo.

**Slater** hosts the legacy JS at `slater.app/17625.js`. The previous developer
is gone; files are fetchable by pasting URLs into a browser. Nine files total,
two of which (`menu.js`, scrollbar CSS) load site-wide — **do not remove the
Slater loader until all nine are ported.**

